{"id":"00fdfbf9fbcbfdf7","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category.md","title":"ZFC Cat2 Opposite Category","display":"df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category — ZFC Cat2 Opposite Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category"],"display":"df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category — ZFC Cat2 Opposite Category","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category — ZFC Cat2 Opposite Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category\">../batch04/58-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C^{op}\">\\(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C^{op}\\)</span> (category data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\)</span> (category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category\">../batch04/58-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob},\\operatorname{Hom},\\circ,\\operatorname{id}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob},\\operatorname{Hom},\\circ,\\operatorname{id}\\)</span> (category structure operators)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2OppositeCategory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2OppositeCategory}_S\\)</span> (opposite-category predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}opposite\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal C^{op},\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C^{op})\\land\n\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^{op})=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^{op}}(A,B)=\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,A)\\Bigr)\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall A,B,D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^{op}}(A,B)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^{op}}(B,D)\\;\ng\\circ_{\\mathcal C^{op}}f=f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\Bigr)\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal C^{op}}(A)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal C}(A)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}opposite\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal C^{op},\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C^{op})\\land\n\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^{op})=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^{op}}(A,B)=\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,A)\\Bigr)\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall A,B,D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^{op}}(A,B)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^{op}}(B,D)\\;\ng\\circ_{\\mathcal C^{op}}f=f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\Bigr)\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal C^{op}}(A)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal C}(A)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S$ (category predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-category]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C^{op}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob},\\operatorname{Hom},\\circ,\\operatorname{id}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2OppositeCategory}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}opposite\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal C^{op},\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C^{op})\\land\n\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^{op})=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^{op}}(A,B)=\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,A)\\Bigr)\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall A,B,D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^{op}}(A,B)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^{op}}(B,D)\\;\ng\\circ_{\\mathcal C^{op}}f=f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\Bigr)\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal C^{op}}(A)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal C}(A)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1571,"backlinks":[{"id":"429dd2b96f81efcc","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCat2OppositeCategory}_S$ (opposite-category predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1586","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category.md|58-df-zfc-cat2-opposite-category]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a87b7e1119b63b2c","e637becf421e4e61"]}